+# P2.0 fluid 吞吐抽象离散反例沙箱报告
+
+本报告只基于 `p2_0_prompt_3_sandbox_counterexamples.md` 和 `p2_0_throughput_with_design_v1.zip` 中的设计稿/规则内容。新增代码是一个自足 Python tick 仿真器、手工 fluid witness 校验器、实例 JSON 导出和复现实验脚本。
+
+复现命令：
+
+```bash
+python3 experiments/p2_0_discrete_counterexamples.py
+python3 experiments/p2_0_discrete_counterexamples.py --json
+python3 experiments/p2_0_discrete_counterexamples.py --dump-instances
+```
+
+输出文件：
+
+- `experiments/p2_0_discrete_counterexamples.py`：仿真器 + fluid witness checker + 案例套件。
+- `experiments/p2_0_discrete_counterexample_instances.json`：全部 JSON 实例。
+- `experiments/p2_0_discrete_counterexample_results.json`：本次 12000 tick / 2000 warmup 的复现实测结果。
+
+## 仿真语义假设
+
+- One tick has two phases: components first try to emit queued/output items, then internal state advances.
+- A belt is a FIFO pipeline with one-item cell capacity and one-cell-per-tick motion.
+- A source offers at most one item/tick. Rate sources use an accumulator; pattern sources repeat exactly and stall when backpressured.
+- A merger has one-slot input buffers and one-slot output buffer; policy is fixed-priority or round-robin.
+- A splitter has one input slot. Type-blind mode ignores commodity; filter mode maps commodity to an output port.
+- A machine waits until all recipe inputs are buffered, runs for ticks_per_cycle, and blocks completion if its output queue is full.
+- Machine input capacity is explicit per instance; the default is the recipe count for that commodity.
+- Sink measurements count accepted items after warmup; sinks in toy misrouting cases accept all commodities so wrong deliveries are visible instead of hidden as backpressure.
+
+敏感性标注：belt 速度采用“每 tick 移动 1 格”，这是设计稿 D1 未知量的一个沙箱假设。CE1/CE2/CE3 的结论主要依赖仲裁、分流、初始库存，不依赖具体 belt 速度；CE4 依赖有限 FIFO、不可绕行、机器每商品输入槽有限。如果真实游戏机器有无限分商品库存、自动过滤/旁路，CE4 会消失；如果只是速度或路径长度变化，CE4 可以通过调整 FIFO 长度/突发长度复现。
+
+fluid 判定器说明：小实例采用手工构造的 `fluid_witness`，代码逐项校验 T1 守恒、T2/T3 容量、T4 机器耦合、T5 目标满足、T6 源口上限。它不是通用 LP 优化器，但满足本任务允许的“小实例直接手工构造流”。
+
+## 总览
+
+- 默认/对抗语义下，fluid 可行但离散短缺的实例数：**4**。
+- 最宽容语义（公平轮询 merger + blocked-skip splitter + 可过滤 splitter）下仍剩：**2**。剩下的是 `CE3` 的 A4 bootstrap 问题和 `CE4` 的新 FIFO-HOL/机器同步问题。
+
+| 实例 | 归类 | fluid | 默认实测目标 | 默认判定 | 宽容实测目标 | 宽容判定 |
+|---|---|---:|---|---|---|---|
+| `CE1_merger_fixed_priority_starves_low_branch` | A2 merger fairness violation | 可行 | `{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 1.0}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.0}}` | 短缺 | `{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 0.5}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.5}}` | 达标 |
+| `CE2_type_blind_splitter_cannot_demix_shared_fifo` | A3 splitter mixed-commodity separability violation | 可行 | `{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 0.25}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.25}}` | 短缺 | `{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 0.5}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.5}}` | 达标 |
+| `CE3_cycle_bootstrap_empty_start_deadlocks` | A4 bootstrap reachability violation | 可行 | `{'machine:m_ab': {'B': 0.0}, 'machine:m_ba': {'A': 0.0}}` | 短缺 | `{'machine:m_ab': {'B': 0.0}, 'machine:m_ba': {'A': 0.0}}` | 短缺 |
+| `CTRL_cycle_bootstrap_sufficient_wip_reaches_fluid_rate` | control: A4 bootstrap witness supplies sufficient initial WIP | 可行 | `{'machine:m_ab': {'B': 1.0}, 'machine:m_ba': {'A': 1.0}}` | 达标 | `{'machine:m_ab': {'B': 1.0}, 'machine:m_ba': {'A': 1.0}}` | 达标 |
+| `CE4_mixed_fifo_head_of_line_blocks_synchronizing_machine` | NEW: finite FIFO head-of-line blocking at synchronizing machine input | 可行 | `{'sink:sink_c': {'C': 0.0}}` | 短缺 | `{'sink:sink_c': {'C': 0.0}}` | 短缺 |
