+
+fluid 判定：`feasible = True`。默认离散实测目标：`{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 0.25}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.25}}`，目标差距：`{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 0.25}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.25}}`。宽容语义实测目标：`{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 0.5}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.5}}`，目标差距：`{'sink:sink_a': {'A': 0.0}, 'sink:sink_b': {'B': 0.0}}`。
